{"3264960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cardburners", "steam_appid": 3264960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4743700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CardBurners is a fast paced, solo or online versus card game. <br>You must play your cards quickly before they burn in your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/1b822f4f92017874b9be8deb19a614df.poster.avif?t=1783066690\" width=1030 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/1b822f4f92017874b9be8deb19a614df.webm?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/1b822f4f92017874b9be8deb19a614df.mp4?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards keep piling up in your hand so you'll have to analyze quickly and play your cards wisely before your hand is full.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A Chaotic strategy game:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Play solo against AIs or Online with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Choose your pace, the game can deal cards as fast as 100 cards per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Tailor your game rules, mixing them from many different card packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Defeat your opponent using damage cards, making them overdraw or placing bombs in their hands...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A Varied selection of packs:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Every pack of cards comes with very different rules, using varied game mechanics like observation, logic or reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ You can play each pack separately or mix and match to unique game configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Some packs are inspired by classic card and board games (Hanafuda, crazy8, Old maid).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Each card pack comes with its own graphical style creating a rich and varied atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/fd6d186bd2e9c03f4eedbf653209d8ff.poster.avif?t=1783066690\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/fd6d186bd2e9c03f4eedbf653209d8ff.webm?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/fd6d186bd2e9c03f4eedbf653209d8ff.mp4?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Team:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: GrosChevaux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer: Billy Palmer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound FX: Noodle Noise </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CardBurners is a fast paced, solo or online versus card game. <br>You must play your cards quickly before they burn in your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/1b822f4f92017874b9be8deb19a614df.poster.avif?t=1783066690\" width=1030 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/1b822f4f92017874b9be8deb19a614df.webm?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/1b822f4f92017874b9be8deb19a614df.mp4?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards keep piling up in your hand so you'll have to analyze quickly and play your cards wisely before your hand is full.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A Chaotic strategy game:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Play solo against AIs or Online with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Choose your pace, the game can deal cards as fast as 100 cards per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Tailor your game rules, mixing them from many different card packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Defeat your opponent using damage cards, making them overdraw or placing bombs in their hands...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A Varied selection of packs:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Every pack of cards comes with very different rules, using varied game mechanics like observation, logic or reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ You can play each pack separately or mix and match to unique game configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Some packs are inspired by classic card and board games (Hanafuda, crazy8, Old maid).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Each card pack comes with its own graphical style creating a rich and varied atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/fd6d186bd2e9c03f4eedbf653209d8ff.poster.avif?t=1783066690\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/fd6d186bd2e9c03f4eedbf653209d8ff.webm?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/extras/fd6d186bd2e9c03f4eedbf653209d8ff.mp4?t=1783066690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Team:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: GrosChevaux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer: Billy Palmer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound FX: Noodle Noise </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "CardBurners is a chaotic fast-paced, solo or online versus card game. You must play your cards quickly before they burn in your hand! Mix and match completely different sets of cards and rules to create unique action packed games.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/8e170d226dc23ffa8e61db5dda467dc9b32132dc/header.jpg?t=1783066690", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/5a75c9b406426277723cb525414e499965fda654/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783066690", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264960/5a75c9b406426277723cb525414e499965fda654/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783066690", "website": "https://groschevaux.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard or onboard chipset</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 760 or AMD Radeon R7 370<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versio